{"timestamp": 1779352346.0802581, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 8, "data": {"caller": "player_1", "reason": "Bob reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779352346.0810912, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 8, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779352353.9492562, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I found Alice dead in medbay. My route was lower_engine, then storage, and finally up to medbay for my scan task. She was just lying there when I walked in. Unfortunately, I didn't see anyone passing me or leaving the area, so I don't have a lead on the killer. Did anyone see someone heading away from medbay or the center of the map recently? Please share your routes so we can piece this together."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352366.8233547, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Good find, Bob. I was completely out of the area for this one. I started up in Oxygen, finished my task there, and then moved down to Upper Engine. I was just stepping into the Cafeteria when the report happened. \n\nSince I didn't see anyone cross my path on the top left side, whoever killed Alice must have slipped out of Medbay towards Electrical or maybe went straight up into Cafeteria before I got there. Charlie, Diana, Eve \u2014 were any of you on the right side of the map or near Electrical?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779352376.6386538, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started off in weapons and then headed down to security to do my cameras task. Diana, you might have some explaining to do. At tick 6, I saw Diana enter security coming from the direction of electrical. Since electrical is directly connected to medbay where the body was found, she definitely had the opportunity to slip away from the crime scene before Bob got there. \n\nDiana, what was your route before electrical? Did you see anyone else over there? Charlie, we still need to hear from you too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352388.7596278, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Eve is right about my route\u2014I started the round in electrical and then moved into security, which is where I ran into her. However, I never stepped foot in medbay, and I didn't see anyone pass through electrical while I was there. \n\nIf the killer slipped away from medbay, they didn't come my way. Since Bob came from storage, the killer likely didn't go down either, which means they probably headed up toward cafeteria before Frank got there, or maybe Charlie has some information for us. Charlie, where were you this round? I'm safe, and Eve can vouch that I was just chilling with her in security at the end."}}
{"timestamp": 1779352410.8829513, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 8, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Listen up everyone, I have the final piece of the puzzle, and I just caught someone in a massive lie. Frank is the Duck.\n\nMy route was very simple: I started the round in Medbay (it was completely empty, Alice wasn't there yet), and then I moved directly left into Upper Engine. I was sitting in Upper Engine doing my task when the report happened, and I didn't see a single soul the entire time.\n\nFrank, your story is completely made up. You claimed you went from Oxygen down to Upper Engine, and were \"just stepping into the Cafeteria.\" \nFirst of all, I was in Upper Engine and I didn't see you once. \nSecond, look at the map! Upper Engine doesn't even connect directly to the Cafeteria. To get to Cafeteria from Upper Engine, you'd either have to backtrack through Oxygen, or pass right through Medbay\u2014the exact room where Alice was murdered. \n\nFrank faked his path and messed up the map layout. He probably killed Alice in Medbay and is trying to distance himself from the body. I'm voting Frank, and I strongly suggest you all do the same."}}
